cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin in scientific publications, please cite it as indicated below."
title: "Hypsometric Curve: QGIS 4 Plugin for Hypsometric Analysis"
abstract: >
  Hypsometric Curve is a QGIS 4 plugin that computes the hypsometric curve
  of a drainage basin starting from a Digital Elevation Model (DEM) and a
  polygon representing the basin boundary. It calculates h_min, h_max, h_med,
  the Hypsometric Integral (HI), partial and cumulative areas, and generates
  an interactive hypsometric curve graph with export options. The plugin uses
  GDAL rasterization (ALL_TOUCHED=TRUE) for maximum accuracy and performance,
  and includes full compatibility with QGIS 4 and Qt6.

